      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CESSNA TITAN (2) copped a check in the run and finished a well held 16 lengths eighth (20.96) last time in a Grade 5 at this track over 350m. Should be in this for a long way. RUNWAY JADE (4) is rarely far away but tends to find one better, placing 13 from 21 starts. Finished in the minors last time when second (19.90) at this track making it back to back placings. Has a good record here at this journey. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Winning chance. OZA AUDACITY (8) was a winner (20.15) at this track two back but out of the placings last time when 6th at Geelong. Is yet to taste defeat in two starts from this draw. One of the main contenders. HAPPY LIFE (1) has claims fresh from a recent placing.",
